        "attribution": "Jelezko and Wrachtrup were central to single-defect optical control, with Lukin a major contributor to the broader quantum-control framework.",
        "maturity": "Diamond-spin sensing is reproducible and deployed across magnetic imaging and nanoscale metrology.",
